# shellcheck shell=bash disable=SC2034
# Config e7-pd-mooncake-1p1d-dp2 -- E7 bring-up: 1P1D PD over vLLM MooncakeConnector, P = TP1xDP2 (2 GPUs), D = TP1xDP2
# (2 GPUs), vllm-router PD mode in front. ONE file describes both roles; launch with scripts/kit/serve_pd.sh (NOT serve.sh).
# PD_CONFIG=1 makes serve.sh / render_all.sh route this file to serve_pd.sh.
#
# BASE = r1-dp2-c128 (CI row 448240 worker argv/env, token-identical per review 11-19). Changes vs r1, all forced or
# required by PD, each cited (V = source/vllm @ 7a62ca06, close to the image 60bd6dd2; MC = V/vllm/distributed/
# kv_transfer/kv_connector/v1/mooncake/mooncake_connector.py; VR = source/vllm-router @ 0.1.17 main; tags 0.1.14/0.1.16
# fetched to notes/pd_e7/router_*_v0.1.1x.rs):
#  1. --kv-cache-dtype fp8_ds_mla (both roles). Any non-UMBP connector turns the AITER sparse-MLA path off
#     (V/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/amd/rocm.py:95-109 `_aiter_sparse_mla_enabled`, gate = `only_restores_canonical_kv`,
#     V/.../kv_connector/v1/base.py:236-244, Mooncake does not override it) and fp8_e4m3 is then rejected at load
#     (V/vllm/models/deepseek_v4/amd/rocm.py:167-172; seen first-hand on e4-r1nosp 11-19 10:4xZ). Measured colocated cost of
#     this forced combo (e4b, fp8_ds_mla + Triton sparse): 221,199 vs R1 255,797 tok/s/GPU at c128 (-13.5%, single runs).
#  2. --kv-transfer-config MooncakeConnector, kv_producer (P) / kv_consumer (D) (V/vllm/config/kv_transfer.py:88-117;
#     roles: MC:1413-1414 is_kv_producer/is_kv_consumer; P starts sender threads + bootstrap server MC:1511-1537, D the
#     receiver loop MC:1539-1545). kv_connector_extra_config keys read by MC:
#       mooncake_protocol  MC:1422-1424 (default "rdma"; also read by supports_sleep_mode MC:935-936)
#       device_name        MC:1425-1427 -> TransferEngine.initialize(hostname, "P2PHANDSHAKE", protocol, device_name)
#                          (mooncake/transfer/te.py:31-42); "" = discover every RDMA device; comma whitelist otherwise
#                          (V/docs/features/mooncake_connector_usage.md). Default "" here (HIP->PCI->NUMA map of this node
#                          is not measured; rocm-smi index != HIP index, team-polls 12:21Z).
#       num_workers        MC:1415-1417 (P sender thread pool, default 10; #5090 uses 10)
#       kv_lease_duration  MC:728-737 (unset -> VLLM_MOONCAKE_ABORT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT 480 s, V/vllm/envs.py:286)
#       bootstrap_server_address MC:3504-3553 (unset -> embedded server on P TP0/PP0 of DP index 0, bound 0.0.0.0:
#                          VLLM_MOONCAKE_BOOTSTRAP_PORT (MC:1536); P workers register at data_parallel_master_ip
#                          (default 127.0.0.1, V/vllm/config/parallel.py:270) for internal-LB DP)
#     kv_load_failure_policy "fail" = the default (V/vllm/config/kv_transfer.py:117), set explicitly: a failed pull must be
#     loud during bring-up, not silently recomputed.
#  3. VLLM_MOONCAKE_BOOTSTRAP_PORT on P only (V/vllm/envs.py:257 default 8998; MC:3526-3553). D needs none: it gets
#     remote_bootstrap_addr + remote_engine_id per request from the router (MC:785-792; VR vllm_pd_router.rs
#     build_mooncake_decode_kv_transfer_params). Each P instance on a host needs its own port (docs). The ZMQ side channel
#     binds a random port (MC:1705) on get_ip() (MC:1410).
#  4. VLLM_HOST_IP=<node ip> on both roles: get_ip() returns it first (V/vllm/utils/network_utils.py:52-63); it is the
#     Mooncake engine hostname (MC:1410, te.py:41) and the side-channel bind address (MC:1653, 1705).
#  5. --data-parallel-rpc-port distinct per role (P 29550, D 29650): two internal-LB DP2 engines on one node; default 29550
#     (V/vllm/config/parallel.py:272). The DP master port is auto-picked from open ports (parallel.py:1229-1233).
#     VLLM_PORT / NIXL side-channel / KV-event env ports also distinct per role (srtctl-injected env in CI, kept).
#  6. D: --no-enable-prefix-caching (BooleanOptionalAction for bool fields, V/vllm/engine/arg_utils.py:386, 1418) = all
#     NVIDIA vLLM PD rows (dynamo_vllm.md L6). With PCP=1 this does NOT flip swa_bounded_replay (only PCP>1 does,
#     V/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py:627-634), so P and D keep the same replay setting (g3 hazard H2 avoided).
#  7. SAME --speculative-config on both roles (DSpark synthetic 3.51): recipe "DSpark runs in both pools so the transferred
#     KV stays compatible" (V/recipes/models/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash.yaml:2084-2086, GB200 NIXL context); MC:2096-2110
#     group-count check; g3 H1. `prefill_context_kv_only` (V/vllm/config/speculative.py:683-690) is a later A/B, not here.
#  8. --attention-config indexer mxfp4 + sparse logits on both roles (r1 has it; required explicitly on ROCm:
#     dynamo_vllm.md A5, V/vllm/model_executor/models/config.py:770-790 auto-enables only on CUDA).
#  9. Env from IX #5090 (MiniMax vLLM Mooncake PD AgentX on MI355X, notes/pd_e7/ix_pr5090.diff:92-120), not in vLLM code:
#     VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT=600 (V/vllm/envs.py:287 default 30; bootstrap register/query timeout, MC:1661, 2906),
#     PYTHONHASHSEED=0 ("Prefill and decode must hash prefix blocks alike"), HSA_ENABLE_IPC_MODE_LEGACY=1,
#     MC_MAX_CONCURRENT_REG_MR=1 ("each rank registers its whole KV region with every NIC"), VLLM_HTTP_TIMEOUT_KEEP_ALIVE=3600
#     ("outlast the router's pooled-connection idle gaps"). Effects on THIS image: unverified.
#     NOT set (unknown on our fabric; set per PD_README if RDMA fails): MC_GID_INDEX, MC_IB_TC, MC_MAX_MR_SIZE (#5090: P 1 GiB,
#     D 256 MiB), MOONCAKE_DISABLE_HIP_DMABUF (TileRT MI355X recipe sets 0).
# 10. Docker: /dev/infiniband + IPC_LOCK + memlock (DOCKER_RDMA=1). DOCKER_IONIC_PROVIDER=0 by default: whether the 60bd
#     image has an ionic verbs provider is unverified (#5090 mounted the host's for its image); PD_README step 1 decides.
# Router: vllm-router PD mode on 0.1.14 = the version the bar installs (wheel already in $NFS/wheels). Verified first-hand
#   on tag v0.1.14 (GitHub raw, saved in debug/pd_e7_finish/router_v0114/, 2026-11-19): src/main.rs has --vllm-pd-disaggregation
#   (:135), --prefill URL [BOOTSTRAP_PORT] parsed before clap (:13-37, :738), --prefill-policy/--decode-policy (:147-152),
#   --intra-node-data-parallel-size (:188), --kv-connector (:369); src/config/types.rs:114-123 KvConnector {nixl, mooncake}.
#   src/routers/http/vllm_pd_router.rs (v0.1.14): Mooncake mode queries http://<prefill host>:<port|8998>/query ONCE when
#   the router is built (:1350-1390, 30 retries, backoff <= 10 s) and caches engine_id per DP rank; a rank missing from that
#   answer silently FALLS BACK to the first engine id (:180-195) -> serve.sh pre-waits until /query lists both P ranks.
#   Prefill gets stream=false, max_tokens=1, X-data-parallel-rank and kv_transfer_params {do_remote_decode, transfer_id}
#   (:140-150, :295-335, :545-570); decode gets {do_remote_prefill, transfer_id, remote_bootstrap_addr, remote_engine_id}
#   (:163-178) and its response is streamed back (:1192-1260). vLLM side: /query returns dict[dp_rank -> EngineEntry]
#   (V/.../mooncake/mooncake_utils.py:56, 129-177); the bootstrap server binds 0.0.0.0 (MC:1536), so the router reaches it
#   on the node IP. v0.1.14 -> v0.1.16.1 commit titles (gh compare) touch MoRIIO, gRPC cleanup, "strip @rank suffix in DP
#   intra-node GET proxy URLs (#221)" - nothing Mooncake-specific. 0.1.16 = IX #5090 pin, 0.1.17 adds kv_aware PD (#386):
#   later A/Bs (set ROUTER_VERSION and run pull_images.sh --router-wheel). Policy consistent_hash on all three (= bar).
# Not CI: no InferenceX DSv4.1 vLLM PD recipe exists (SYNTHESIS s0). Prefill DP>1 behind Mooncake is supported by the
#   connector (per-dp_rank registration, mooncake_utils.py RegisterWorkerPayload) and by the router (dp_engine_ids), but
#   srt-slurm#669 rejects prefill DP pools in ITS launcher; untested anywhere we know -> bring-up risk R1 in PD_README.
CFG_ID=e7-pd-mooncake-1p1d-dp2
PD_CONFIG=1
CFG_SOURCE="r1-dp2-c128 (CI row 448240) + PD changes 1-10 above; router per IX #5090 / srt-slurm#669"
IMAGE="vllm/vllm-openai-rocm:nightly-60bd6dd2edd175a1c55fd3488f871e4c3d2ef27d@sha256:67a3a0fb79893fc5a0fcff5f9b739ba8fec7e920875a12e0574c2e9f50cd814c"
GPU_SELECT=device-ids           # as r1: --device-ids, all node GPUs visible in each container
IPC=host
DOCKER_RDMA=1
DOCKER_IONIC_PROVIDER=0
CONCURRENCY=128                 # first point = R1's c128 at 4 GPUs (R1 ran c128 on 2 GPUs); sweep later (E14/E8)
BENCH_TP=4                      # harness TP env = GPU denominator = P GPUs + D GPUs (run_point gpus=4)
DISAGG=true
DP_SIZE=2                       # both roles DP2 (run_point DP_ATTENTION metadata)

P_GPUS_NEEDED=2
D_GPUS_NEEDED=2
# Base ports; serve_pd.sh adds --port-offset N to every one of them.
P_PORT=6100;  D_PORT=6200       # engine HTTP (+ /metrics)
P_BOOTSTRAP_PORT=8998           # Mooncake bootstrap server on P (VLLM_MOONCAKE_BOOTSTRAP_PORT)
P_DP_RPC_PORT=29550; D_DP_RPC_PORT=29650
P_VLLM_PORT=20000; D_VLLM_PORT=20200
P_NIXL_PORT=5400;  D_NIXL_PORT=5600
P_KV_EVENT_PORT=3000; D_KV_EVENT_PORT=3200
ROUTER_PORT=8000; ROUTER_PROM_PORT=18000

MOONCAKE_PROTOCOL=rdma          # MC:1422-1424; "tcp" only as a bring-up fallback (not a perf config)
MOONCAKE_DEVICE_NAME=""         # MC:1425-1427; e.g. "ionic_0,ionic_1,ionic_2,ionic_3" (NUMA0 NICs, preflight n10-29)
MOONCAKE_NUM_WORKERS=10         # MC:1415-1417

SPEC_CONFIG='{"method": "dspark", "num_speculative_tokens": 5, "draft_sample_method": "probabilistic", "rejection_sample_method": "synthetic", "enable_adaptive_verification": false, "synthetic_acceptance_length": 3.51}'

# Tokens: @MODEL@ @PORT@ @DEVICE_IDS@ @NODE_IP@ @VLLM_PORT@ @NIXL_PORT@ @KV_EVENT_PORT@ @ROUTER_PORT@ @ROUTER_PROM_PORT@ are
# substituted by serve.sh per role; @KV_TRANSFER_CONFIG@ @DP_RPC_PORT@ @BOOTSTRAP_PORT@ @SPEC_CONFIG@ @P_HOST@ @D_HOST@
# @P_PORT@ @D_PORT@ by serve_pd.sh.
COMMON_ENV=(
  AITER_TRITON_LOG_LEVEL=ERROR
  DYN_VLLM_KV_EVENT_PORT=@KV_EVENT_PORT@
  HEAD_NODE_IP=@NODE_IP@
  OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
  PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
  ROUTER_VERSION=0.1.14
  VLLM_NIXL_SIDE_CHANNEL_HOST=@NODE_IP@
  VLLM_NIXL_SIDE_CHANNEL_PORT=@NIXL_PORT@
  VLLM_PORT=@VLLM_PORT@
  VLLM_ROCM_QUICK_REDUCE_QUANTIZATION=NONE
  VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER=1
  VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_MOE=1
  VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER_TRITON_SPARSE_MLA=True      # kept as r1; ignored by the connector gate (rocm.py:95-109 warns once)
  VLLM_USE_BREAKABLE_CUDAGRAPH=1
  VLLM_USE_RUST_FRONTEND=1
  # ---- PD additions ----
  VLLM_HOST_IP=@NODE_IP@
  VLLM_MOONCAKE_CONNECTOR_TIMEOUT=600
  PYTHONHASHSEED=0
  HSA_ENABLE_IPC_MODE_LEGACY=1
  MC_MAX_CONCURRENT_REG_MR=1
  VLLM_HTTP_TIMEOUT_KEEP_ALIVE=3600
)
P_ENV_EXTRA=( VLLM_MOONCAKE_BOOTSTRAP_PORT=@BOOTSTRAP_PORT@ )
D_ENV_EXTRA=()

COMMON_CMD=(
  vllm serve @MODEL@ --host 0.0.0.0 --port @PORT@ --device-ids @DEVICE_IDS@
  --attention-config '{"indexer_kv_dtype":"mxfp4","indexer_sparse_logits":true}'
  --block-size 128
  --data-parallel-size 2
  --data-parallel-rpc-port @DP_RPC_PORT@
  --disable-uvicorn-access-log
  --enable-auto-tool-choice
  --engram-config '{"cpu_offload":true}'
  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.9
  --kv-cache-dtype fp8_ds_mla
  --kv-transfer-config @KV_TRANSFER_CONFIG@
  --language-model-only
  --max-cudagraph-capture-size 1024
  --max-model-len 1048576
  --max-num-batched-tokens 16384
  --moe-backend aiter
  --prefill-schedule-interval 11
  --reasoning-parser deepseek_v41
  --served-model-name deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
  --speculative-config @SPEC_CONFIG@
  --tensor-parallel-size 1
  --tokenizer-mode deepseek_v41
  --tool-call-parser deepseek_v41
)
P_CMD_EXTRA=()
D_CMD_EXTRA=( --no-enable-prefix-caching )

P_KV_TRANSFER_CONFIG='{"kv_connector":"MooncakeConnector","kv_role":"kv_producer","kv_load_failure_policy":"fail","kv_connector_extra_config":{"mooncake_protocol":"@MOONCAKE_PROTOCOL@","device_name":"@MOONCAKE_DEVICE_NAME@","num_workers":@MOONCAKE_NUM_WORKERS@}}'
D_KV_TRANSFER_CONFIG='{"kv_connector":"MooncakeConnector","kv_role":"kv_consumer","kv_load_failure_policy":"fail","kv_connector_extra_config":{"mooncake_protocol":"@MOONCAKE_PROTOCOL@","device_name":"@MOONCAKE_DEVICE_NAME@","num_workers":@MOONCAKE_NUM_WORKERS@}}'

ROUTER_ENABLE=1
ROUTER_VERSION=0.1.14           # = bar; PD Mooncake support verified on tag v0.1.14 (header). 0.1.16/0.1.17 = later A/B
ROUTER_CMD=(
  vllm-router --vllm-pd-disaggregation --kv-connector mooncake
  --prefill http://@P_HOST@:@P_PORT@ @BOOTSTRAP_PORT@
  --decode http://@D_HOST@:@D_PORT@
  --host 0.0.0.0 --port @ROUTER_PORT@
  --intra-node-data-parallel-size 2 --worker-startup-timeout-secs 3600
  --policy consistent_hash --prefill-policy consistent_hash --decode-policy consistent_hash
  --prometheus-host 127.0.0.1 --prometheus-port @ROUTER_PROM_PORT@ --request-timeout-secs 14400 --disable-retries
)
UMBP_ENABLE=0
